  <item>
    <title>48、2024投资”翻倍“大揭秘！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677552491e823e72d37a3d42</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677552491e823e72d37a3d42</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2025 14:41:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi！2025如约而至，比以往来得更快一些！你的2024怎么样？和江湖传言君一起来总结一下吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span>整体来说，2024年算是一个“小牛市”，但投资里确实几家欢喜几家愁，四喜的深套账户已躺平，师兄的翻倍股大揭秘，还有薇薇师妹的散户养成记，大家也一起回顾下2024年的投资经历吧～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FloipuTxAoW9h46FovoNyBe2kLXG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>高光时刻：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 2024关键词：些许遗憾 和投资躺平！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 被“深套”的账户该割肉吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">08:45</a> 师兄的“翻倍”投资经历大揭秘！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1101">18:21</a> 与“170%”收益擦肩而过的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/aVYSsBD4OUaYw5vpId8dxw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/aVYSsBD4OUaYw5vpId8dxw"><span>10月8日我亲手把师妹套在了3674高地</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 荐gu没朋友是真的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">30:32</a> 2025年投资策略和投资方向在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">39:44</a> 金融打工人小有成就的一件事 ！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2562">42:42</a> 新年快乐密码！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>祝各位听友朋友们，2025年投资长虹！</span></h2>]]></description>
